{"id": "contract-window-donations", "title": "Contractors’ own officers donate to the officials approving their contracts", "seconds": 121.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "6944a02f1f72e3aa", "words": 390, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "In San Francisco, a contractor’s top people can’t give money to the officials who approve its contract.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.68, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "City contractor", "sub": "wants a contract"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Supervisors, Mayor or City Attorney", "sub": "approve it"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Campaign committees", "sub": "no gifts from the contractor’s officers"}], "kicker": "The rule"}, "emph": ["can’t"], "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.87, 0.98, 1.54, 1.78, 2.14, 2.35, 2.54, 2.77, 2.89, 3.01, 3.4, 3.52, 3.8, 3.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "So we checked. Since 2019, how many donations came from those people, inside that window?", "t0": 4.8, "t1": 10.94, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Inside the window", "sub": "since 2019"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.29, 1.52, 1.8, 2.09, 2.75, 2.93, 3.11, 3.67, 3.86, 4.0, 4.17, 4.7, 5.03, 5.17]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[1]"], "text": "53.", "t0": 10.94, "t1": 11.65, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "53", "label": "donations, name and employer both matching"}, "emph": ["53"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "Each one is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 12.17, "t1": 13.86, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.44, 0.56, 0.64, 0.98, 1.15, 1.21]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "span", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The ban runs from the day they bid until twelve months after the yes.", "t0": 14.08, "t1": 17.54, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-02-15", "to": "2023-02-15", "days": "365", "fromLab": "proposal submitted", "toLab": "twelve months after approval", "kicker": "The window"}, "emph": ["twelve months"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.35, 0.57, 0.72, 0.82, 1.03, 1.23, 1.72, 2.0, 2.28, 2.52, 2.74, 2.86]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "span", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "It covers contracts of 100,000 dollars or more.", "t0": 17.66, "t1": 20.12, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-02-15", "to": "2023-02-15", "days": "365", "fromLab": "proposal submitted", "toLab": "twelve months after approval", "kicker": "The window"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.85, 0.97, 1.12, 1.35, 1.69, 2.01, 2.14]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "The first lead is how we found them. One City form names each contractor’s officers.", "t0": 20.34, "t1": 24.58, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Contract approval form", "sub": "names the officers"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Campaign filing", "sub": "names donor and employer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Same name, same employer", "sub": "53 matches"}], "kicker": "The first lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.38, 0.57, 0.66, 0.78, 0.89, 1.12, 1.69, 1.94, 2.2, 2.53, 2.82, 3.06, 3.64]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "Campaign filings name each donor, and where they work.", "t0": 24.7, "t1": 27.32, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Contract approval form", "sub": "names the officers"}, {"art": "magnifier", "name": "Campaign filing", "sub": "names donor and employer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Same name, same employer", "sub": "53 matches"}], "kicker": "The first lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.92, 1.14, 1.35, 1.71, 1.83, 2.04, 2.2]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "Names matched 773 donations.", "t0": 27.44, "t1": 30.04, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "773", "label": "donations where a listed officer’s name matches a donor", "sub": "53 with the employer matching too"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.71, 1.01, 1.28, 1.8]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "In 53, the employer matched too: very likely the same person.", "t0": 30.16, "t1": 33.85, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "773", "label": "donations where a listed officer’s name matches a donor", "sub": "53 with the employer matching too"}, "emph": ["employer"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.82, 0.95, 1.33, 1.6, 2.33, 2.58, 2.91, 3.01, 3.23]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[2]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "For the other 720, the records do not show whether this is the same person.", "t0": 33.97, "t1": 37.92, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "720", "label": "donations where the name is the only link"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.23, 0.49, 0.75, 1.0, 1.47, 1.65, 1.98, 2.13, 2.31, 2.52, 2.82, 3.08, 3.22, 3.32, 3.53]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[3]"], "text": "How much? 13,400 dollars in all. Each was 100 to 500 dollars.", "t0": 38.04, "t1": 43.66, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "53 donations", "kicker": "The first lead", "chip": "$13,400"}, "emph": ["13,400"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 1.23, 1.68, 2.09, 2.31, 2.53, 2.84, 2.97, 3.64, 3.91, 4.09, 4.27, 4.55, 4.64, 4.9, 5.12]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]"], "text": "So why care about small sums? The rule keeps people who need a vote from paying the people who cast it.", "t0": 43.78, "t1": 48.92, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "it exists to keep people who depend on a vote from funding the people who cast it"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.38, 0.56, 0.77, 1.06, 2.09, 2.26, 2.5, 2.78, 3.05, 3.16, 3.34, 3.41, 3.71, 3.89, 4.15, 4.25, 4.52, 4.65, 5.01]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "story[5]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Are they bunched around approvals? No. The calendar alone would put 52 inside.", "t0": 49.04, "t1": 53.26, "shot": "b11c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["inside a window", "53"], "b": ["what the calendar alone gives", "52"], "kicker": "The same donors’ 248 donations", "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.28, 0.58, 0.8, 1.87, 2.13, 2.24, 2.66, 2.94, 3.09, 3.26, 3.71]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "26 came in the twelve months after an approval.", "t0": 53.38, "t1": 55.68, "shot": "b11d", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "26", "label": "of the 53 in the twelve months after an approval", "sub": "5 followed by a refund entry"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.58, 0.79, 0.9, 0.99, 1.26, 1.5, 1.71, 1.78]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The second lead is Chinese Hospital. Its chief executive gave money on both sides of two contract votes.", "t0": 55.9, "t1": 61.12, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Chinese Hospital", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "COVID surge-capacity contracts"}, "emph": ["both sides"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 0.61, 0.73, 1.1, 2.01, 2.23, 2.47, 2.97, 3.18, 3.41, 3.54, 3.8, 4.12, 4.2, 4.36, 4.78]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "First, the Board approved its surge contract.", "t0": 61.24, "t1": 63.33, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-02-15", "to": "2022-09-22", "days": "219", "fromLab": "Board approval", "toLab": "$500 to Gordon Mar", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.47, 0.7, 1.06, 1.2, 1.5]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "219 days later, the chief gave 500 dollars to Supervisor Gordon Mar.", "t0": 63.45, "t1": 67.92, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-02-15", "to": "2022-09-22", "days": "219", "fromLab": "Board approval", "toLab": "$500 to Gordon Mar", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "emph": ["219 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.46, 0.82, 1.04, 1.69, 1.84, 2.13, 2.35, 2.59, 2.8, 3.16, 3.28, 3.85, 4.12]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Then 500 dollars to candidate Sharon Lai.", "t0": 68.04, "t1": 70.22, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-11-05", "to": "2023-12-12", "days": "37", "fromLab": "$500 to Sharon Lai", "toLab": "Board approval", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.42, 0.63, 1.0, 1.11, 1.5, 1.82]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "37 days later, the Board approved another surge contract.", "t0": 70.34, "t1": 73.7, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-11-05", "to": "2023-12-12", "days": "37", "fromLab": "$500 to Sharon Lai", "toLab": "Board approval", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "emph": ["37 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.73, 1.36, 1.52, 1.76, 2.13, 2.45, 2.75]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The documents don’t tell us why.", "t0": 73.82, "t1": 75.21, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Both dates fall inside the period from proposal to twelve months after approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.55, 0.74, 0.92, 1.03]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third lead is Dolores Street Community Services, now Mission Action.", "t0": 75.43, "t1": 78.83, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Dolores Street Community Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "now Mission Action"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.6, 0.7, 1.09, 1.33, 1.74, 2.5, 2.71, 3.03]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Its director gave 500 dollars to candidate Jackie Fielder.", "t0": 78.95, "t1": 81.85, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-05-07", "to": "2024-07-16", "days": "70", "fromLab": "one approval", "toLab": "another approval", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.61, 0.82, 1.1, 1.33, 1.68, 1.79, 2.17, 2.46]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "51 days after one approval, and 19 days before another.", "t0": 81.97, "t1": 85.18, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-05-07", "to": "2024-07-16", "days": "70", "fromLab": "one approval", "toLab": "another approval", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "emph": ["19 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.82, 1.09, 1.23, 1.73, 1.92, 2.31, 2.53, 2.8]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "The fourth lead is Central City Hospitality House. The Board approved 300,000 dollars in grants.", "t0": 85.4, "t1": 90.13, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Central City Hospitality House", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "chip": "$300,000"}, "emph": ["300,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.58, 0.68, 1.0, 1.23, 1.83, 2.45, 2.62, 2.82, 3.11, 3.34, 3.56, 3.85, 4.14, 4.23]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Its chief gave 150 dollars to candidate John Avalos. How soon after the vote?", "t0": 90.25, "t1": 95.12, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "How soon after?", "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.54, 0.75, 0.9, 1.15, 1.46, 1.82, 1.92, 2.33, 2.55, 3.53, 3.72, 3.91, 4.1, 4.21]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Eleven days.", "t0": 95.12, "t1": 95.92, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "11", "label": "days after the vote", "sub": "seven days before the next approval"}, "emph": ["Eleven"], "wt": [0.04, 0.4]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two in 2021: 3,850 dollars for Norman Yee’s committee, 750 for Sandra Lee Fewer’s.", "t0": 96.54, "t1": 103.42, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Ethics penalties for accepting contractor money", "rows": [["Norman Yee’s committee, 2021", "3850"], ["Sandra Lee Fewer’s committee, 2021", "750"], ["Since then", "0"]]}, "emph": ["2021"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.31, 0.59, 1.5, 1.79, 2.22, 2.44, 2.7, 2.99, 3.37, 3.52, 3.8, 3.99, 4.82, 5.1, 5.35, 5.72, 5.87, 6.18, 6.34]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "None in the five years since. Yet 38 of the 53 gifts came in 2022 or later.", "t0": 103.54, "t1": 109.56, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "None since", "kicker": "The fifth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.48, 0.59, 0.82, 1.04, 1.97, 2.24, 2.93, 3.04, 3.15, 3.73, 4.08, 4.3, 4.4, 4.72, 5.36, 5.59]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records do not show any gift broke the law, or why 5 show a refund.", "t0": 109.78, "t1": 113.56, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any single donation broke the law", "Why 48 were kept when 5 show a refund"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.52, 0.68, 0.87, 1.1, 1.28, 1.5, 1.74, 1.86, 2.23, 2.44, 2.68, 3.01, 3.22, 3.3]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? An Ethics Commission review.", "t0": 113.68, "t1": 116.06, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "An Ethics Commission review"}, {"who": "", "what": "Later filings: were gifts returned?"}, {"who": "", "what": "Each proposal date and contract value"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.31, 0.63, 1.13, 1.33, 1.64, 2.04]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "No authority has reviewed these donations.", "t0": 116.18, "t1": 118.14, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 0.67, 1.01, 1.2]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 118.26, "t1": 120.23, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.35, 0.45, 0.52, 1.06, 1.26, 1.35]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Lead 1 · 83 matches", "lead2": "Lead 2 · both sides of two votes", "lead3": "Lead 3 · between two approvals", "lead4": "Lead 4 · eleven days", "lead5": "Lead 5 · no penalty since 2021", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}